      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَنِفٌ</span></b>  <i>Suspected</i> (O, K, TA) of a thing (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِأَمْرٍ</span>);
app. a possessive epithet; and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُطَنَّفٌ</span></b>  signifies
the same. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <i>Intrinsically corrupt.</i>
(K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And One <i>who eats little:</i> (O, K:) thus
expl. by Esh-Sheybánee. (O.)

